  [x] git-branch            Current Git branch (omitted when unavailable)
  [x] thread-title          Current thread title, or thread identifier when unnamed
  [ ] C+ Notification       Cutex notification priority (Alt+N to cycle)
  [ ] C+ Working Directory  Working directory with configurable display aliases
  [ ] C+ Agent Name         Agent name and assigned project badge
